m":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/da/1c/217386_crt_Pc2M5.jpg"},"name":"NYTI","summary":"幸運の星に願いをかけた、一人目の少女。\r\n\r\nテレンスの親友であり、一番の理解者。ゴス系のファッションを好み、いつも彼の話に耳を傾け、時には背中を押すように励ます。自分自身も重いものを抱えながら、それでも前を向いて歩き続けている。","relation":"配角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/f9/59/34477_prsn_JLI80.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/f9/59/34477_prsn_JLI80.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/f9/59/34477_prsn_JLI80.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/f9/59/34477_prsn_JLI80.jpg"},"name":"弘松芹香","short_summary":"弘松 芹香（ひろまつ せりか、11月8日 - ）は、日本の女性声優。高知県出身。賢プロダクション所属。","career":["seiyu"],"id":34477,"type":1,"locked":false},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/82/92/104853_prsn_Q9Lrt.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/82/92/104853_prsn_Q9Lrt.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/82/92/104853_prsn_Q9Lrt.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/82/92/104853_prsn_Q9Lrt.jpg"},"name":"Jeanne Chartier","short_summary":"","career":["artist","seiyu","actor"],"id":104853,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":217386},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/4b/c0/217387_crt_OoA4W.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/4b/c0/217387_crt_OoA4W.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/4b/c0/217387_crt_OoA4W.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/4b/c0/217387_crt_OoA4W.jpg"},"name":"NEIL","summary":"先生か、それともハンターか。\r\n\r\n現実では哲学を教える教師、ドリームランドでは冷静沈着な追跡者。穏やかな物腰の奥に真意を隠し、狙った相手を確実に追い詰めていく。静かな佇まいの裏に、炎を操る者としての凄まじい力を秘めている。","relation":"配角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/70/c3/4254_prsn_99K43.jpg?r=1631019573","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/70/c3/4254_prsn_99K43.jpg?r=1631019573","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/70/c3/4254_prsn_99K43.jpg?r=1631019573","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/70/c3/4254_prsn_99K43.jpg?r=1631019573"},"name":"浪川大輔","short_summary":"浪川 大輔（なみかわ だいすけ、1976年4月2日 - ） は、日本の声優、俳優、歌手、ナレーター。ステイラック代表取締役。","career":["artist","seiyu","actor"],"id":4254,"type":1,"locked":false},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/94/ae/104854_prsn_DJw1c.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/94/ae/104854_prsn_DJw1c.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/94/ae/104854_prsn_DJw1c.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/94/ae/104854_prsn_DJw1c.jpg"},"name":"Charles Mendiant","short_summary":"","career":["seiyu"],"id":104854,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":217387},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/2f/5c/217388_crt_SwdSB.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/2f/5c/217388_crt_SwdSB.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/2f/5c/217388_crt_SwdSB.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/2f/5c/217388_crt_SwdSB.jpg"},"name":"JUNG","summary":"誰よりも先に、ドリームランドへ訪れた。\r\n\r\nかつてドリームランドを旅した、伝説の元旅人。謎多き老人でありながら、その世界の秘密を誰よりも知る。穏やかで物静かに見えるが、若きトラベラーたちをそっと正しい道へと導いていく。","relation":"配角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/77/4b/3891_prsn_Q44Iz.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/77/4b/3891_prsn_Q44Iz.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/77/4b/3891_prsn_Q44Iz.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/77/4b/3891_prsn_Q44Iz.jpg"},"name":"田中正彦","short_summary":"日本の男性俳優、声優。大阪府出身。以前は劇団昴に所属していた。\r\n\r\nアニメにも出演しており、『聖戦士ダンバイン』のショット・ウェポン、『頭文字D』の須藤京一、『はじめの一歩』の間柴了で知られる。\r\n\r\n『機動戦士ガンダム』では、DVD版やゲームなどで、急死した塩沢兼人の代役としてマ・クベの声を担当する。\r\n\r\n2014年4月30日をもって、長年所属していた劇団昴を退団した。","career":["seiyu"],"id":3891,"type":1,"locked":false},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/e9/17/104856_prsn_8oQ8t.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/e9/17/104856_prsn_8oQ8t.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/e9/17/104856_prsn_8oQ8t.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/e9/17/104856_prsn_8oQ8t.jpg"},"name":"Martial Le Minoux","short_summary":"","career":["seiyu"],"id":104856,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":217388},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/47/4b/217389_crt_o2ic9.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/47/4b/217389_crt_o2ic9.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/47/4b/217389_crt_o2ic9.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/47/4b/217389_crt_o2ic9.jpg"},"name":"ASMODHEUS","summary":"炎のすべては、俺が支配する。\r\n\r\nドリームランドに君臨する、炎の絶対的支配者。圧倒的な力と権威で炎を操る者すべてを従え、誰もその前に立ちはだかることはできない。その名は、ドリームランドに生きる者たちの恐怖そのもの。","relation":"配角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/3f/9b/3864_prsn_Sgipq.jpg?r=1455697884","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/3f/9b/3864_prsn_Sgipq.jpg?r=1455697884","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/3f/9b/3864_prsn_Sgipq.jpg?r=1455697884","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/3f/9b/3864_prsn_Sgipq.jpg?r=1455697884"},"name":"諏訪部順一","short_summary":"日本の男性声優、ナレーター、歌手。東京俳優生活協同組合所属。","career":["artist","seiyu"],"id":3864,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":217389},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/ce/bd/227267_crt_Q26oT.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/ce/bd/227267_crt_Q26oT.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/ce/bd/227267_crt_Q26oT.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/ce/bd/227267_crt_Q26oT.jpg"},"name":"Felix","summary":"","relation":"配角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/34/e7/52937_prsn_fwxz9.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/34/e7/52937_prsn_fwxz9.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/34/e7/52937_prsn_fwxz9.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/34/e7/52937_prsn_fwxz9.jpg"},"name":"吉田健司","short_summary":"","career":["seiyu"],"id":52937,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":227267},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/91/16/227268_crt_3c4bL.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/91/16/227268_crt_3c4bL.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/91/16/227268_crt_3c4bL.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/91/16/227268_crt_3c4bL.jpg"},"name":"Jimmy","summary":"","relation":"配角","actors":[{"