あるわけねぇだろ！\r\n\r\nテレンスの兄。筋トレ一筋の脳筋気味な青年で、弟に対しては冷たく当たったりからかったりしてばかりいる。だがその裏には、テレンスと同じ傷を抱えながらも、それを誰にも見せられない不器用さが隠れている。","name":"BEN","infobox":[{"key":"别名","value":[{"k":"日文名","v":"ベン"}]},{"key":"性别","value":"男"},{"key":"引用来源","value":[{"v":"https://www.dreamland-anime.com/"}]}],"stat":{"comments":0,"collects":0},"id":217385,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"male","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/15/dd/227434_crt_WMySw.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/15/dd/227434_crt_WMySw.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/15/dd/227434_crt_WMySw.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/15/dd/227434_crt_WMySw.jpg"},"summary":"","name":"Shun","infobox":[{"key":"别名","value":[{"k":"日文名","v":"シュン"}]},{"key":"性别","value":"男"}],"stat":{"comments":0,"collects":0},"id":227434,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"female","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/16/1a/227271_crt_Aj1u7.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/16/1a/227271_crt_Aj1u7.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/16/1a/227271_crt_Aj1u7.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/16/1a/227271_crt_Aj1u7.jpg"},"summary":"","name":"Fontaine","infobox":[{"key":"别名","value":[]},{"key":"性别","value":"女"}],"stat":{"comments":0,"collects":0},"id":227271,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"female","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/da/1c/217386_crt_Pc2M5.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/da/1c/217386_crt_Pc2M5.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/da/1c/217386_crt_Pc2M5.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/da/1c/217386_crt_Pc2M5.jpg"},"summary":"幸運の星に願いをかけた、一人目の少女。\r\n\r\nテレンスの親友であり、一番の理解者。ゴス系のファッションを好み、いつも彼の話に耳を傾け、時には背中を押すように励ます。自分自身も重いものを抱えながら、それでも前を向いて歩き続けている。